# System Documentation & DPG Compliance

#  Problem Solved
Eliminates manual calculation errors, speeds up customer checkout, automatically enforces discount policies, and generates clear customer receipts for SmartBuy Supermarket.

# Features
* Multi-item listing using dynamic lists.
* Automated 10% discount calculation above Le 500.
* Infinite loop handling for multiple customers.

#  Future Improvements
* Integration with a database (e.g., SQLite) for sales history.
* Graphical User Interface (GUI).
* Barcode scanner support.

#  Real Business & Societal Impact
Provides small retail businesses with a cost-free point-of-sale solution to improve operational accuracy, build customer trust, and streamline sales tracking.
